        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "8. Time paid will be measured in increments of one-tenth (1/10) of an hour. A run/trip will be assigned a minimum number of hours during September of each year. If that run/trip should increase during the school year by more than one (1) hour and it is probable that it will continue to be longer during the next school year, the run will be rebid during the summer. Drivers will remain on their assigned runs for the school year even if their hours are increased throughout that school year to limit the number of mid-year changes.",
            "block_bbox": [
