        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "9. Once the driver or attendant is assigned to his/her run, during the summer for regular education routes and October for special education routes, the driver or attendant is guaranteed the assigned hours for the entire year unless the following occurs:",
            "block_bbox": [
                83,
